<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-switching-between-local-branches">
  <title>Switch Between Local Branches</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>switching branches</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>local branches</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_knw_kly_kpb">To switch between local branches:</p><ul id="ul_f5q_vqm_pjc">
        <li>On <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol>, open the <uicontrol>Branch</uicontrol> drop-down
        menu and choose a branch to switch to.</li>
        <li>On <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"
          format="dita"><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref>, double-click a local
        branch to switch to it.</li>
      </ul>
    <p><fig id="fig_cqn_kdk_mjc">
        <title>Branch dropdown on Git Staging</title>
        <image href="img/staging/staging_choose_branch_menu.png" id="image_px2_5jt_njc"
        />
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p id="p_lnw_kly_kpb">To create a new branch:</p>
    <ul id="ul_sm5_frm_pjc">
      <li>On <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol>, right-click a commit and select <uicontrol>Create
          Branch</uicontrol>.</li>
      <li>On <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"
          format="dita"><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref>, right-click a branch and
        select <uicontrol>Create Branch</uicontrol>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To check out a commit and switch to a branch on <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol>, see <xref
        href="git-addon-check-out-a-branch.dita#git-addon-check-out-a-branch">Check Out a
        Branch</xref>.</p>
  </body>
</topic>
